# REAL-TIME GUI WEATHER APPLICATION (AnikaLang 1.2)
# Uses Open-Meteo API (free, no API key needed)
# Features: Live weather, 7-day forecast, auto-refresh, persistent favorites
# Fully resizable UI with default system fonts
# ==============================================================================

